{"ID":"20230926142058-dmvm4p2","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230926142058-dmvm4p2","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926142058-dmvm4p2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926142102-xdgfyea\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926142102-dxk712j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926142102-dxk712j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"【麻黄加术汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230926142102"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230926142102-xdgfyea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926142102-xdgfyea","updated":"20230926142102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：麻黄三两、桂枝二两、杏仁七十个、甘草一两（炙）、白术四两"}]},{"ID":"20230926142102-mn3stox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926142102-mn3stox","updated":"20230926142102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右五味，以水九升，先煮麻黄，减二升，去上沫，纳诸药，煮二升半，去滓，温服八合，覆取微汗，不汗再服，得汗停后服。"}]},{"ID":"20230926142102-dxk712j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926142102-dxk712j","updated":"20230926142102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"湿气。"}]}]}